      "instance_name": "ironic_contempt",
      "label": "ironic contempt emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is ironic contempt, conveyed through the juxtaposition of the majestic, dangerous mountain with the text that reflects on the tragic deaths of climbers and ends with the sarcastic advice to 'stay lazy, my friends.' This creates a tone of mocking dismissal toward ambition and risk-taking, implying that the sacrifices made by the deceased climbers are ultimately meaningless or foolish.",
